  "description": "Core abstractions, contracts, and shared infrastructure for the Vali-Blob ecosystem.\n        Provides the IBlobProvider interface, IBlobContainerClient, resumable upload contracts\n        (IResumableUploadStore, IResumableUploadSession), Polly-based retry pipeline,\n        DI extension helpers, and provider-agnostic models.\n        This package is the foundation required by all Vali-Blob provider packages\n        (AWS, Azure, GCP, OCI, Supabase, Local) and utilities (Redis, EFCore, HealthChecks, ImageSharp).",
